      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6728353::web::018::atomistic_modeling_of_hea_nanoparticles"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "At elevated temperature, entropy-dominated stabilization preserves both chemical homogeneity and the disordered nanoparticle structure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC3598001::web::001::body",
        "PMC4976365::web::001::body",
        "PMC6728353::web::018::atomistic_modeling_of_hea_nanoparticles"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Near 1923 K, the nanoparticles will remain chemically homogeneous and retain a single-phase solid-solution structure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC3598001::web::001::body",
        "PMC4976365::web::001::body"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Near 473 K, minor local ordering or chemical short-range order may become detectable.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4976365::web::001::body"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Despite possible local ordering near 473 K, the overall nanoparticle structure will remain largely stable.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
